#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:3
msgid "操控深度与连接：信息如何在网络中流动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:5
msgid "第二件装备：补给线。高海拔还能呼吸吗？跳跃连接、密集连接、特征融合。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`../image-net-era/res-net` 揭露了一个惊人的事实：堆更多的层不一定更好，反而可能更差。根源在于{ref"
"}`gradient-vanishing`——梯度在反向传播中逐层衰减，浅层收不到训练信号。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:9
msgid "但 ResNet 只展示了跳跃连接这一种解法。本节从更根本的角度审视：**信息如何在网络中流动？有哪些方式保证信息不丢失？**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:11
msgid "信息流动的三种通路"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:93
msgid "串行链——梯度消失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:95
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"普通网络只有一个路径：Layer 1 → Layer 2 → … → Layer n。信息在串行中丢失，梯度在乘法中归零。这就是{ref"
"}`arch-intro`中讨论的**信息传不过去**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:97
msgid "跳跃连接——信息捷径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ResNet 的核心原理和梯度推导已在 {doc}`../image-net-era/res-net` "
"中详细介绍。从架构设计角度，我们提炼为一条核心原则："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:101
msgid "**每个模块都应该有一条\"不做任何事\"的退路。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:103
msgid "数学上，$y = F(x) + x$ 中的 $+x$ 就是这条退路："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:105
msgid "梯度可以沿跳跃路径直接回传（$+1$ 项），不受残差分支影响"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:106
msgid "即使残差分支梯度消失，主梯度依然能保持（保底机制）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:108
msgid "这解释了为什么 ResNet 能训练 100+ 层网络，而普通网络在 20 层就会退化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:110
msgid "密集连接——信息高速公路"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:112
msgid "DenseNet 把跳跃连接推到了极致：**每一层都连接到后面所有层**。这创建了一个密集的信息网络，梯度有多条路径可以回传，几乎不可能完全消失。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:114
msgid "三种连接方式的对比："
msgstr ""

