msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:212
msgid "**操控连接的黄金法则**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:214
msgid "每个模块都需要一条\"退路\"（恒等映射）——至少一层一跳"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:215
msgid "特征融合不是简单的拼接，而是**不同抽象层次的双向对话**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:216
msgid "连接方式的选择取决于你的瓶颈：深度（加跳跃）还是尺度（做融合）"
msgstr ""

