msgid "**场景**：你的网络只有 4 层，但每层都加了残差连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:225
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:242
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:259
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:276
