msgid "训练反而变慢了"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:228
msgid "最终准确率没有提升"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:230
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:247
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:264
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:281
msgid "**为什么失败**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:232
msgid "残差连接解决的是**深层网络**的梯度消失问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:233
msgid "4 层网络的梯度本来就能正常回传，$\\gamma^4$ 不会太小"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:234
msgid "额外的 $+x$ 操作引入了不必要的计算，反而可能破坏特征的逐层变换"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:236
msgid "**教训**：**残差连接是\"药\"，不是\"保健品\"**。10 层以下不需要，20 层以上才考虑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:238
msgid "案例二：DenseNet 的内存爆炸"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:240
msgid "**场景**：你设计了一个 100 层的 DenseNet，每层都接收之前所有层的输出。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:244
msgid "训练时 GPU 内存溢出（OOM）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:245
msgid "即使 batch size=1 也跑不动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:249
msgid "DenseNet 的特征图数量随深度线性增长"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:250
msgid "第 $L$ 层需要存储之前 $L-1$ 层的所有特征图"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:251
msgid "100 层 DenseNet 的特征图数量是普通网络的 50 倍"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:253
msgid "**教训**：**密集连接的信息收益有边际递减效应，但内存消耗是线性增长的**。DenseNet 更适合 20-40 层，而不是 100+ 层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:255
msgid "案例三：跳跃连接位置放错"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:257
msgid "**场景**：你把 U-Net 的跳跃连接从\"编码器→解码器同层\"改成了\"编码器最深层→解码器最浅层\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:261
msgid "分割边缘模糊"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:262
msgid "小目标检测不到"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:266
msgid "U-Net 跳跃连接的核心是**同尺度特征融合**（28×28 对 28×28）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:267
msgid "编码器深层是 4×4，解码器浅层是 56×56——尺度不匹配"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:268
msgid "上采样后的 4×4→56×56 丢失了精确定位信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:270
msgid "**教训**：**特征融合的前提是空间对齐**。跳跃连接不是\"随便连\"，而是需要精心设计融合点的位置。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:272
msgid "案例四：FPN 中忘记横向连接"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:274
msgid "**场景**：你实现了 FPN，但只做了自上而下的上采样，没有横向连接（lateral connection）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:278
msgid "小目标检测率提升不明显"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:279
msgid "整体 mAP 比标准 FPN 低 2-3 个点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:283
msgid "纯上采样的深层特征虽然语义强，但空间精度差（混叠效应）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:284
msgid "没有横向连接引入的浅层高分辨率特征，小目标定位不准"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:285
msgid "这正是 FPN 论文强调 lateral connection 的原因"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:287
msgid "**教训**：**FPN 的价值在于\"双向融合\"，不是单向传递**。少了横向连接，就退化成普通的上采样金字塔。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:289
msgid "决策树：如何选择连接策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:313
msgid "**核心原则**：连接策略服务于**信息流动问题**。先诊断问题（梯度消失？信息丢失？多尺度？），再选策略，不要盲目堆叠连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/model-architecture-design/part3-depth-connection.md:317
#, python-brace-format
msgid "通路畅通了。但网络知道该看哪吗？第三件装备——{doc}`part4-attention`。"
msgstr ""

